message: "If you use this corpus, please cite the paper below."
title: "Japanese SemCor (JSemCor)"
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A sense-tagged corpus of Japanese, created by translating the English
  SemCor corpus and projecting the sense tags onto the Japanese
  translation using the Japanese Wordnet.
